``Configuration.builder().base_url(...)`` to select a server::

    config = Configuration.builder() \\
        .base_url(SERVER_0.get_url()) \\
        .build()

For servers with variables, pass overrides::

    url = SERVER_1.get_url({'environment': 'staging'})
"""

